[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0270","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0270.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0641","title":"Linux man 程序 -S 选项堆溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 系统中 man 程序在处理 -S 选项参数时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当本地用户向 man 命令传递超长的 -S 选项参数时，可触发缓冲区溢出，进而以 man 用户组权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Immunix OS 6.2/7.0、RedHat 5.2/6.2/7.0、S.u.S.E 6.x/7.0/7.1 等多个 Linux 发行版。攻击者需在目标系统上具有本地访问权限才能利用此漏洞，成功利用后可获得与 man 用户组等价的操作权限，可能导致敏感文件被读取或系统被进一步控制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0641"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:40Z","remediation":"立即安装各发行版安全更新：RedHat Linux 5.2/6.2 升级 man 包至 1.5i-0.5x.1/0.6x.1，RedHat 7.0 升级至 1.5i-4，SuSE Linux 6.x/7.0/7.1 及 Immunix OS 6.2/7.0 应用对应厂商安全补丁，执行 rpm -Fvh man*.rpm（RHEL）或 rpm -Uvh man*.rpm（SuSE/Immunix）。如无法立即升级，可临时以 root 执行 chmod -s /usr/bin/man 移除 man 程序的 setgid 位作为缓解措施，或通过 /etc/sudoers 限制普通用户执行 man 程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0087.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_019_man_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-069.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/190136","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2711","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6530","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20843","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/341a98a6a53723fa96a8872087b0601d6cdf2538/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0641.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0641","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0641.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/661818a489d196676957d469a0bf9cda171fbbe9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0641.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cab47a53355fe3bc502e03be3bcadddb7f126733/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x5hv-pj66-v68q/GHSA-x5hv-pj66-v68q.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0641.json","https://github.com/dmc5179/rhsa-tools/blob/677b19c223fe2771414f7b2fc89b4a4f39d25719/cvrfs/RHSA-2001:069.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0270.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0216","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0216.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0552","title":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager OVActionD SNMPNotify 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager (NNM) 6.1 及 IBM Tivoli NetView 5.x/6.x 中的 ovactiond 组件在处理特定 SNMP 陷阱消息时，未对用户输入中的 shell 元字符进行有效过滤，存在命令注入漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送特制的 SNMP 陷阱消息，利用 shell 元字符执行任意系统命令，从而完全控制受影响的服务器。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重，影响范围广泛。目前已有公开的利用代码，攻击门槛较低。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0552"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 HP OpenView NNM 至 6.1 以上补丁版本，或升级 Tivoli NetView 至 7.x 版本。如无法升级，可停止 ovactiond 服务（`kill -9 <PID>` 或从启动脚本中移除），并在防火墙上限制 SNMP 161/162 端口仅允许可信源 IP 访问，同时过滤 SNMP trap 消息中的 shell 元字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99201278704545&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-24.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952171","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2845","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20909","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0552.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0552","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0552.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0552.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5965518125739d48e98f0cf3efbf7359253ff7cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-58wf-w6hc-fcfx/GHSA-58wf-w6hc-fcfx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0552.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--903d30cb-433d-4fc7-aa59-22236e528b99.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2845/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0216.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0202","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0202.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0507","title":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 In-Process Table 权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 5.0 在处理进程内系统文件查找时使用相对路径，导致本地权限提升漏洞。攻击者可在受影响系统上放置特洛伊木马文件，当 IIS 加载进程内组件时，由于路径解析机制缺陷，系统会优先加载攻击者放置的恶意文件而非原始系统文件，从而以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 上运行的 IIS 5.0 版本，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用。Microsoft 已发布安全公告 MS01-044 修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0507"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:26Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-044 提供的累积补丁 (Q301625)，或升级至 Windows Server 2003 及以上版本。如无法升级，在 IIS 管理器中禁用不必要的 ISAPI 扩展和应用程序映射，限制本地用户对系统目录的写入权限，并确保 %windir%\\system32 等关键目录仅允许 Administrators 完全控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/205069","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-132.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/5607","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-044","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6985","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A909","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A912","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21072","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0507.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0507.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0507","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0507.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0507.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/74884340187670a91b9d5bdb799b52e73426ad63/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p9gc-mhgg-w6vh/GHSA-p9gc-mhgg-w6vh.json","https://github.com/mitre/cti/blob/ea1adfe1a68ca3dcfe2dd883180b8cf10a988824/enterprise-attack/relationship/relationship--a9830f35-1ffa-46a3-b061-07148dd09753.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0507.yaml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/iis_decode_bug.nasl","https://github.com/chihsuan/search-engine/blob/9dcdd3e644469883f53565740f0ba8ff617c5120/Data/E99D88C1-C798-40D7-BB8C-47E6405B9469.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0202.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0201","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0201.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0506","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 SSI 缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 和 5.0 的 ssinc.dll 组件中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当服务器端包含（SSI）指令处理超长文件名时，目录名被拼接触发缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够以系统权限执行任意代码。本地攻击者需拥有在目标 IIS 服务器上上传包含恶意 SSI 指令文件的能力，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 和 5.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0506"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:26Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-044 提供的 IIS 累积安全补丁。IIS 4.0 补丁下载：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=7DD8F695-FA97-4378-B57B-7BCCF3533BE3，IIS 5.0 补丁下载：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=F74552AC-4313-4F93-9412-539DCA0753EB。安装前确保 Windows NT 4.0 已安装 SP5 或 SP6a，Windows 2000 已安装 SP1 或 SP2。如无法立即打补丁，作为临时缓解措施，应严格限制非授权用户向服务器上传文件的权限，并禁用不必要的服务器端包含（SSI）功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99802093532233&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/242541","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-132.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3190","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-044","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6984","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21071","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0506.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0506.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0506","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/